    "moment": [
      {
        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "He had an important impact on art in the Dutch Republic when in 1585 he showed his friend Hendrick Goltzius drawings by Bartholomeus Spranger. … These drawings had a galvanising effect on Goltzius whose style was influenced by them.",
        "lead": "On Karel van Mander:",
        "source": {
          "author": "Wikipedia contributors",
          "title": "Karel van Mander",
          "publisher": "Wikipedia",
          "readAt": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Karel_van_Mander",
          "accessed": "2026-11-03",
          "tier": 5,
          "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "They also had a preference for depicting exaggeratedly brawny musclemen, violent drama, wild fantasy and a heightened richness of detail.",
